<title>USA: AMG says $294 mln muni fund inflows in latest week.</title>
<headline>AMG says $294 mln muni fund inflows in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMG Data Services said $294 million flowed into municipal bond funds for the week ended April 2.</p>
<p>The inflows represented a 0.15 percent increase in assets due to investor flows as compared to a decline of 0.42 percent of the assets due to market action.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
